  "content": "<p>Since a while, we have a lent screen printing machine in the lab and one of our members is currently doing a lot of experiments with it.</p><p>Here are some impressions from the first self-made Munich Maker Lab screen and the first prints.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/screenprinting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>screenprinting</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/printmaking\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>printmaking</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makers\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makers</span></a></p>",
